# Checked by 'make check-fork-additions'. The point is to make an upstream
# merge that silently drops one of our files fail loudly instead of shipping.
# This list includes the guardrails themselves — deleting the contract test
# or this manifest is exactly the kind of loss it has to catch.
#
# 'make check-fork-additions-sync' reports when this list has gone stale and
# prints the diff to apply. It needs upstream fetched:
